# ABP SMS Sending

## Using ISmsSender
```csharp
public class MyService : ITransientDependency
{
    private readonly ISmsSender _smsSender;

    public async Task SendOtpAsync(string phoneNumber, string code)
    {
        await _smsSender.SendAsync(new SmsMessage(phoneNumber, $"Your code: {code}"));
    }
}
```

## Implementation
ABP provides abstraction only. Implement `ISmsSender` for your SMS provider (Twilio, etc.).
